  },
  "documentation": {
	"summary": "Nine existing columns, a clear forecourt, and a small learner shaft beside the entrance.",
	"layout": "22x30m. Colonnade at (11,16), its bases lifted clear of the floor. Four authored exhibits retained. Dress on a plinth; voice lowered.",
	"student_bay": "Hall-local (5,0,10), yaw180, unit scale. Temporary learner installation in captures; not another authored exhibit.",
	"route": "Walk between the nine columns, then reach the supported exit at (11,27).",
